    "text": "The solution of the differential equation <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is (where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;is an arbitrary constant)"
